'''The Scratching Post''' (つめとぎの廊下, ''Tsumetogi no Rōka,'' '''Nail Sharpening Hall''') is the 14th sub-chapter of [[Stories of Legend]]. It was added in [[Version 2.0 Update#Version 2.0.9 Update|Version 2.0.9]] and is available up to {{4c}} difficulty. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], it is the 7th sub-chapter in the Stories of Legend and is available up to 3★ difficulty.

==Difficulty==
Pretty difficult, especially compared to the previous sub-chapters. You should expect to see [[Master A.]], [[Dagshund]] and [[Duche]]. Also, the fifth stage has two extremely strong [[Shy Boy]]s, thus [[:Category:Anti-Floating Cats|anti-Red]]/[[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] units will be helpful. There are no new enemies, so you won't need to worry about that.

This is basically just [[Risqué Terrain]], but with higher strength magnifications.
{{LegendDiff|150|200|300}}

